<title>UK: FIH sets 400 million Danish crown seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>FIH sets 400 million Danish crown seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Den Danske Bank (books) and Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINANCE FOR DANISH INDUSTRY</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON     SIX	 MATURITY    05.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.835   PAY DATE    05.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
